  "title": "Wipro Plans to Set up Digital Innovation Hub in D&uuml;sseldorf, Germany",
  "summary": "D&uuml;sseldorf, Germany and Bangalore, India- September 8, 2020: Wipro Limited (NYSE: WIT, BSE: 507685, NSE: WIPRO), a leading global information technology, consulting and business process services company, today announced plans to set up a Digital Innovation Hub in Düsseldorf, Germany.",
